<section class="section-new" id="feature-create">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="feature-row">
            <div>
                <span class="section-label">Site Creation</span>
                <h2>Sites and stores, built<br>entirely through chat</h2>
                <p class="section-desc">Describe your industry and goals, and AI generates your website, cross-border store, and blog together. It's more than translation — AI studies local competitors to adapt your design and CTAs too.</p>
                <div class="accordion">
                    <details>
                        <summary class="accordion-trigger">Website &amp; landing page creation<span class="acc-icon">+</span></summary>
                        <p class="accordion-body">Describe your industry and goals in chat, then pick a design template. AI builds your site — no code, no design tools needed.</p>
                    </details>
                    <details>
                        <summary class="accordion-trigger">Cross-border e-commerce, built in<span class="acc-icon">+</span></summary>
                        <p class="accordion-body">Product listings, payment setup, and inventory — your store comes together through chat too, with CSV import supported.</p>
                    </details>
                    <details>
                        <summary class="accordion-trigger">Multilingual blog, generated by AI<span class="acc-icon">+</span></summary>
                        <p class="accordion-body">AI researches local SEO keywords and writes complete posts, from title to body.</p>
                    </details>
                    <details>
                        <summary class="accordion-trigger">Localization, not just translation<span class="acc-icon">+</span></summary>
                        <p class="accordion-body">AI studies top-ranking local competitor sites and adapts your design and CTA placement — because a literal translation rarely resonates with local customers.</p>
                    </details>
